B.Ui=new A.ic("bc-training","B.C. Employer Training Grant","Grants & contributions","British Columbia","Cost-sharing support for employee training after you take over or grow a business.","For eligible B.C. employers and training. Check approval timing and current intake before committing to expenses. Does not fund a business purchase.","https://www.workbc.ca/employers-industry/funding-programs/bc-employer-training-grant/frequently-asked-questions")
